{'symbol': 'AMGN', 'date': '2023-04-13 19:54:00', 'title': 'AMGN INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD AMGEN INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES , APRIL 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP ("GPM") ANNOUNCES THAT INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST AMGEN INC. ("AMGEN" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: AMGN).'}